[00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:29.900]   discussions, such as our new business strategies, and our rapid adoption of cost containment programs at the onset of the pandemic, resulted in record second quarter results, with all of our cash flow metrics well above consensus expectations. The 41% rise in second quarter net revenue reflects growth in total television advertising revenue. As we grow year over year increases in same station new television business, and strong shares of political spending in our markets, as well as the 71% year over year increase in distribution
